{
  "format": "simforge.recording-contract-lock/v1",
  "schema": "simforge.recording/v1",
  "digestRule": "sha256 of simforge.canonical-json/v1 over the uncompressed document as written",
  "vectors": "sdk/fixtures/recording/vectors.json",
  "changelog": [
    "v1 locked with ADR 0008: frameRef, the local observation frame, sync.clock, displayName.",
    "Observations (map null) may drop out: contiguous presence (recording_lifecycle_gap) is a registered-recording rule. The compiler still refuses every unregistered recording as a replay source (recording_unregistered).",
    "Lineage: optional derivedFrom {sha256, operation: transfer | register | trim, reportSha256?} (never the recording's own digest: recording_derived_from_self), and optional source.dataset, source.logId, source.label on root recordings.",
    "Lineage: derivedFrom.operation nudge, the import's derivation that moves a track whose spawn footprint overlaps another by at most 0.25 m (the moves are in the import report).",
    "Actor origin openscenario: a track an OpenSCENARIO import sampled from a FollowTrajectoryAction (source.kind openscenario).",
    "Lineage: derivedFrom.operation rollout, a scenario of replay routes simulated on its own map into the recording a transfer warps, derived from the one recording those routes replay (so following derivedFrom from a transfer's warped recording reaches the log)."
  ],
